                        "entry_id": "bf0cde70-93da-3a12-8392-43c524b0fea3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A nature transcending the usual constraints of the physical world."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30a206ca-78c1-46b6-b997-da724079bd1c",
                                "sense_id": "51138331-07da-3564-9b1b-1b43f32e3edc",
                                "text": "\"He might,\" said Bacon, \"though I have small fear of his doubting the supernature of the android. He is much given to superstition, and his strange dream will confirm that bent of mind.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0d544a38-6a2b-33c4-8b07-d054c9cd3026",
                        "entry_id": "bf0cde70-93da-3a12-8392-43c524b0fea3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A supernatural realm beyond or apart from the physical world."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b357583-96f5-458d-8db9-cb65726d7f6f",
                                "sense_id": "0d544a38-6a2b-33c4-8b07-d054c9cd3026",
                                "text": "It is the most commont and grossest blunders of scientific diminutives, to imagine that all in nature is of nature. There are more excellent natures. We ascend the height of argument by means of supernatures. These supernatures are, so to speak, natural manifestations or degrees of the supernatural."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "68ddafd2-a48d-4ea0-8910-274a21ab5243",
                                "sense_id": "0d544a38-6a2b-33c4-8b07-d054c9cd3026",
                                "text": "These peripheral ghosts earn large amounts of money in the streets, and the money they make is a convertible currency in the sense that it enables a contest of power with other higher social classes in supernature."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4f489bfc-f20e-3b2b-9dba-673111f79a48",
                        "entry_id": "bf0cde70-93da-3a12-8392-43c524b0fea3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A supernatural system beyond or apart from the laws of nature."
                        ],
